  note-zh = {BF16 的舍入误差破坏 rollout 与训练器之间的一致性，改用 FP16 即可消除这种失配},
  further = {no},
  tldr    = {The paper traces the numerical mismatch between the inference and training policies in RL fine-tuning to BF16 rounding errors and shows that running both in FP16, a change of a few lines, effectively removes it and gives more stable optimization.},
